which is why it's part of this Army training exercise

596
00:31:39,901 --> 00:31:41,460
at Fort Irwin, California.

597
00:31:45,060 --> 00:31:48,320
Here, six days a week, soldiers are plunged

598
00:31:48,321 --> 00:31:50,240
