but a synthetically created stench

607
00:32:09,781 --> 00:32:12,860
designed to enhance the sensory experience of this exercise.

608
00:32:14,060 --> 00:32:16,640
It's a container that contains an oil substance,

609
00:32:16,641 --> 00:32:19,840
and then it's placed in a machine with a fan on it

610
00:32:19,841 --> 00:32:21,080
that'll push that smell out.

611
00:32:21,840 --> 00:32:24,660
Synthetic stinks like this are useful in numerous ways.

612
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:28,540
