We have different odors coming from different parts of our body.

691
00:37:10,061 --> 00:37:18,780
Bad breath odor that most of us are familiar with is largely a sulfur-based odor.

692
00:37:18,781 --> 00:37:23,580
The odors that come from the axillary glands in our underarms, those tend to have a little

693
00:37:23,581 --> 00:37:28,660
