743
00:40:02,340 --> 00:40:03,900
much stronger than old garbage.

744
00:40:05,340 --> 00:40:06,180
How are you doing?

745
00:40:06,580 --> 00:40:09,600
But the strongest bad breath culprit of all, garlic.

746
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:12,880
Garlic is a problem because it contains

747
00:40:12,881 --> 00:40:14,820
